>Idea:
>	Have every WoP that is created contain only 1 charge, and be
>	already recharged!
>
>This limits polypile without taking it away from the player, and still
>leaves all of the previous abilities of the wand intact, sans change.

In the midst of our noble quest to search for new ways in which to
quench the evil forces of Nethack Abuse, we must not lose sight of
what we may destroy along the path.

Personally I am not too fanatic about limiting polypiling because
nobody forces you to polypile, and almost invariably the knowledge of
polypiling is the result of reading too many spoilers.  But if you
*must* limit polypiling, limiting wands of polymorph is not the
answer.  Note that they are called wands of *polymorph*, not wands of
polypiling.  They have other purposes, which cannot be considered
"abusive" by any reasonable standards.  Any "solution" to polypiling
that limits other purposes of the WoP should not be considered.
